@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

[*] --> Enabled : created
Enabled --> Disabled : disabled, or its web service is turned off
Disabled --> Enabled : enabled, or its web service is turned on
Enabled --> Disabled : rolled back and kept
Enabled --> [*] : deleted
Disabled --> [*] : deleted

state Enabled {
  [*] --> Healthy
  Healthy --> Warning : a non-critical part is missing
  Healthy --> Critical : a needed part is missing
  Warning --> Critical : a needed part is missing
  Warning --> Healthy : the check finds everything
  Critical --> Warning : the check finds the rest
  Critical --> Healthy : the check finds everything
}

note right of Disabled
  Disabling suspends the service user and
  the external service. Nothing is deleted
  and the health check skips the schema.
end note

@enduml
